{"sectionId":"cell/cycle","items":[{"id":"cell--cycle-k001","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"세포주기는 G₁, S, G₂, M으로 구분한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k002","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"S기에 DNA가 복제되지만 동원체 수를 기준으로 센 염색체 수는 그대로다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k003","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"사이클린-CDK 복합체는 표적 인산화를 통해 주기 전환을 조절한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k004","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"G₁/S, G₂/M 및 방추체 조립 점검점은 DNA 손상이나 불완전한 결합을 감시한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k005","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"p53은 DNA 손상 반응에서 p21 발현을 유도할 수 있고, Rb는 E2F를 억제하다","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k006","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"인산화되면 G₁/S 진행을 허용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k007","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"유사분열 중 전기에는 염색체 응축, 전중기에는 핵막 해체와 방추사 결합, 중기에는 중기판 정렬, 후기에는 자매염색분체 분리, 말기에는 핵 재형성이 일어난다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k008","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"APC/C 활성화는 securin 분해와 separase 활성화를 통해 cohesin 절단을 허용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k009","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"동물 세포질분열은 액틴-미오신 수축환, 식물은 세포판을 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k010","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"세포자멸사는 caspase 연쇄 활성화에 의한 조절된 사멸이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k011","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"내인성 경로는 Bcl-2 계열 조절, 미토콘드리아 cytochrome c 방출, apoptosome과 caspase-9가 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k012","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"외인성 경로는 사멸수용체와 caspase-8 등이 관여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k013","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"일반적인 괴사는 막 파열과 염증을 동반하지만 조절된 괴사도 존재한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k014","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"이배체 G₁은 2n,2C; G₂는 2n,4C.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k015","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"APC/C는 유비퀴틴 리가아제이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k016","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"세포자멸사에서 phosphatidylserine 외부 노출과 DNA 절편화가 관찰될 수 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"cell--cycle-k017","sectionId":"cell/cycle","unitId":"cell","subject":"biology","text":"염색체 수는 유지되고 DNA량은 G₁의 두 배가 된다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}